<title>USA: IVAX, Bergen Brunswig settle suit.</title>
<headline>IVAX, Bergen Brunswig settle suit.</headline>
<dateline>ORANGE, Calif. 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>IVAX Corp and Bergen Brunswig Corp said Friday they have agreed to settle litigation arising from the termination of their $1.6 billion merger agreement in March.</p>
<p>Terms of the settlement were not announced.</p>
</text>
